            "type": "text",
            "text": "•narrowing of the aorta MC at the insertion of the ductus arteriosus distal to the origin of the left subclavian vein results in HTN in the arteries proximal to the lesion (e.g., primary arteries supplying the UE) w/ relative hypotension in the LE"
